Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:55:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: run TYPED_V3 jobs for the merged G5P Mesa winsys

Provide render-node GEM, PRIME, VM, targets and syncobj submission with
context isolation, recovery and bounded retirement. Default to the
proven event wake and range sync. Trim retired user mappings when a
context closes while retaining the PM late-write route, following the
device-proven close-BO fix 6824230ee54c. No trim toggle is exposed.

[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 407b7bf2cbbe1df2f93926bbfc0f642ffffbe71e; preserve existing Orchard DRM build hooks.]

Assisted-by: LLM

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Co-authored-by: GPT-6.1 Sol <noreply@openai.com>
